<title>USA: Lufkin, Texas, won by Southwest.</title>
<headline>Lufkin, Texas, won by Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Inc. said it won $3.025 million of Lufkin, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.241 percent.</p>
</text>
